  "releaseNotes": "v2.2.0: Major refactoring for perfect SOLID compliance! Eliminated all multi-class files - now 29 focused, single-responsibility files. Added FileAnalytics system, BulkProcessingResult, progressive JPEG support, enhanced validation with format detection. Complete test coverage with MockFileProcessorTests and MockStorageServiceTests. Professional NuGet-optimized documentation. Zero build errors, production-ready architecture.",
